{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1000_p", "source_sha256": "189599b27c860c02fc52fbf0a6d73baac549c0beb26767ca376d219b4152d352", "ja": "さて、ステージの片づけは大体終わったかな……\nん？　百合子、ステージで何をしてるんだ？", "zh": "好，舞台大致上都整理完了吧……\n嗯？百合子，你在舞台上做什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1001_026yur", "source_sha256": "6917ba8858fa49bfe2527a321ac68a87a55e71157cea92121b3a65296d832eb5", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまでしたっ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n你辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1002_p", "source_sha256": "e7c1fba1bb60e45737e2c22efa5d5e9ed7a3155f16e67341bed67ef8de5d06e7", "ja": "まだ着替えてなかったのか。\n何か忘れ物でもしたのか？", "zh": "你还没换衣服啊。\n是忘了什么东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1003_026yur", "source_sha256": "5aa216b9e01cb138f80e8babe274745f4e314233e3a639b2c7777b819018890a", "ja": "いえ、そうじゃないんですけど。\nもう少しだけ、ライブの余韻に浸っていたくて……。", "zh": "没有，不是的。\n我只是想再感受一下演唱会的余韵……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "da6c99dce6ff1d64281b74c036fe6750a11be012c4951ade73e8b09f904f0d19", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。今日の私達の……\n『乙女ストーム！』のライブ、すごかったですよね？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生，今天我们……\n『少女风暴！』的演唱会很棒吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1005_p", "source_sha256": "fb094c0731d45f164bdd95a478529c567b18c23537e7f0b0d1f2372c5fa2cb28", "ja": "ああ、大成功だったよ。お客さん達を巻き込んで、\n文字通り嵐のようなステージだったと思う！", "zh": "是啊，非常成功。我觉得这场表演就像字面上一样，\n拥有一股宛如风暴般，把观众们也袭卷进来的威力呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1006_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8035de24a04fc29beca2d5fda57802d9db5d6383c9050de3c68a2fc6ba7c1d3", "ja": "やっぱり、そうですよね！？　今日のステージ、\n5人それぞれのパワーが、本当にすごくて……。", "zh": "果然没错！！今天的表演中，\n五个人都各自发挥出非常强大的能量……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "fa773d92111775e43ff16cac7dbc05f966ba0ac5c0cc43960fc994d296e0d7ec", "ja": "私達、得意なこともみんな違って……なのに、\nステージでは、みんなが乙女ストーム！だったんです。", "zh": "明明我们擅长的事情各不相同……\n可是站上舞台后，却能一同化身为『少女风暴！』呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1008_026yur", "source_sha256": "321903451d8e529d8dacfbfe1b8314f9117901e72710bf471eef6e34543a2fc4", "ja": "自分でも、よくわからないんですけど。それって、\nなんだかとっても私達らしいな、って思って。", "zh": "虽然我自己也不太懂，\n但总觉得这样好像很有我们的风格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1009_p", "source_sha256": "c5994fef762728c434e92f88e0f2568eebaf3d516c51bac68624424cab0bd492", "ja": "そうだったな。みんなの個性が溢れてたけど、\nそれ以上に乙女ストーム！らしいライブだったと思う。", "zh": "就是说啊。虽然大家都很有个性，\n但今天的演唱会依然十分有『少女风暴！』的风格呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1010_026yur", "source_sha256": "d1b1562c8992cde396ee1d6df98b517baa316f07b383c32e7b214dcf200f71f2", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nえへへ、ありがとうございます♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n嘿嘿……谢谢你♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_026yur0043_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_026yur0043_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "2bc5432dc087493fa1a7954f88873e55bef720f3b0f5034972560d86becf87d1", "ja": "でも、私達の冒険はまだまだ続きますよ！　これからの\n乙女ストーム！を、楽しみにしていてくださいね♪", "zh": "不过，我们的冒险还会继续下去的！\n请你继续期待今后的『少女风暴！』喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
